          },
          "body": "Changing `conversionAccuracy` in `Duration#reconfigure` now selects the corresponding preset conversion matrix. Custom matrices are preserved unless explicitly replaced.\n\nRegression tests cover both accuracy directions, original immutability, and custom and explicit matrices.\n\nValidated on Node 24.16.0: all 1,230 tests pass, plus builds, formatting, and site generation.\n\nFixes #1824.\n\nPrepared with Codex assistance.\n",
